WEBVTT

00:04.380 --> 00:09.290
The city suffered greatly as a result of the Voids,
but restoration efforts are already under way.

00:10.500 --> 00:14.630
The humans' so-called "power plant," the source
of their mana supply, was also badly damaged.

00:15.040 --> 00:19.040
So until it's repaired, they'll be implementing devices
that convert the Sun's rays into mana.

00:19.920 --> 00:21.880
Both are incredible feats of engineering.

00:22.540 --> 00:26.630
Although I officially claimed this land as my kingdom,
there's still much I don't understand.

00:26.960 --> 00:28.130
It requires more research.

00:35.960 --> 00:36.830
What…?

00:36.830 --> 00:40.630
Vault access must be authorized
by the Administration Bureau.

00:41.380 --> 00:42.500
A spirit?!

00:42.750 --> 00:44.130
So they've managed to survive…

00:44.830 --> 00:47.420
I'm a student at this academy. Let me through.

00:47.710 --> 00:49.670
Please put in a request with the bureau.

00:49.960 --> 00:54.580
Following a review of your credit information, criminal
record, personal history, and academic performance,

00:54.580 --> 00:56.290
you will be given permission to enter.

00:56.710 --> 00:58.000
Well that's a pain…

01:00.130 --> 01:01.380
Guess who!

01:02.080 --> 01:04.880
Please, Miss Regina, we're in public…

01:04.880 --> 01:07.170
Proper social etiquette says
you're supposed to play dumb

01:07.170 --> 01:09.580
and enjoy the sensation of my chest against your back.

01:09.960 --> 01:11.750
I've never heard of etiquette like that!

01:12.000 --> 01:14.830
Did you follow me here just so you could tease me?

01:15.080 --> 01:20.130
I came to return some video software and happened
to see you. What are YOU doing here, kid?

01:20.210 --> 01:22.500
They don't carry porn here, y'know.

01:22.500 --> 01:23.460
I know that!

01:23.960 --> 01:27.960
I came to do some research on the ancient language
written all over those ruins I was trapped in.

01:28.630 --> 01:32.080
I thought it might help me figure out
how to get my memory back.

01:32.080 --> 01:34.000
That ought to be a good enough excuse.

01:35.040 --> 01:39.040
It must be hard… not remembering your own past.

01:39.420 --> 01:41.500
Let your big sis handle this one!

01:46.080 --> 01:49.790
Mr. Spirit, would you be so kind as to let us in?

01:50.250 --> 01:53.710
Regina Mercedes does not have
permission to enter the…

01:58.460 --> 02:00.630
Very well. Go ahead.

02:03.960 --> 02:06.290
Are you a spirit medium, Miss Regina?

02:06.790 --> 02:09.540
Nah, it's just a little parlor trick.

02:10.040 --> 02:12.330
But I'd prefer that you keep it a secret.

02:12.540 --> 02:16.000
Plus, the Phillet Foundation is the company
that manufactures the Artificial Elementals.

02:16.330 --> 02:19.080
Even spirits are man-made nowadays…

02:19.420 --> 02:21.460
Then what happened to all the real spirits?

02:22.130 --> 02:27.880
You must mean the Source Spirits. Everyone says they
were mostly gone by the time the Void invasion started.

02:28.330 --> 02:31.380
I hear they still lurk about in old forests, but…

02:31.670 --> 02:34.580
Ah, the reference text for ancient languages
should be in this section.

02:34.830 --> 02:38.500
You can read it here, but you can't check it out.

02:41.130 --> 02:42.670
It's from the Administration Bureau.

02:43.330 --> 02:47.500
"Only a select few student representatives
are invited to the commendation ceremony,

02:47.500 --> 02:49.420
so please be sure to attend."

02:49.920 --> 02:52.540
Looks like our whole platoon gets to go.

02:52.880 --> 02:56.960
"It will take place on the SS Hyperion
and will be hosted by the Fourth Imperial Princess,

02:56.960 --> 02:59.290
Her Highness Altiria Ray O'ltriese."

02:59.500 --> 03:02.420
Royalty, eh? A perfect opportunity.

03:02.420 --> 03:05.920
It gives me an excuse to ask questions
about the upper echelons of mankind's "empire."

03:07.170 --> 03:08.880
Where are you, Leo?

03:08.880 --> 03:10.830
I had a few errands to run…

03:11.210 --> 03:13.500
Aw, I thought we could have lunch together…

03:14.080 --> 03:17.880
I'm just going to grab something light,
so let's meet up at the harbor later.

03:18.500 --> 03:22.040
You're eating alone?
Make sure to eat your vegetables, okay?

03:22.040 --> 03:22.790
I know-

03:25.210 --> 03:27.170
I think I hurt her feelings…

03:27.580 --> 03:29.580
Ya sure are popular, aren'tcha, kid?

03:30.000 --> 03:32.130
I'll head to the harbor once I'm done with my research.

03:32.670 --> 03:34.790
Feel free to go on ahead without me.

03:34.960 --> 03:37.830
Nah, I'm going to sit this one out.

03:37.830 --> 03:39.920
Have fun with the others!

03:40.880 --> 03:41.460
Huh?

03:41.460 --> 03:42.710
See you later!

05:20.170 --> 05:22.130
<b>THE PRINCESS' SECRET FEELINGS</b>

05:23.710 --> 05:25.880
A commendation ceremony is being held

05:26.000 --> 05:27.500
aboard the SS Hyperion today.

05:26.670 --> 05:31.080
<b>RACE: BLACK LION</b>

05:26.670 --> 05:31.080
<b>BASTEA COLOSSUF</b>

05:27.750 --> 05:29.330
This is our chance to kidnap Altiria,

05:29.330 --> 05:30.670
the Fourth Imperial Princess.

05:31.250 --> 05:33.290
If the princess is taken hostage,

05:31.750 --> 05:36.920
<b>RACE: ELF</b>

05:31.750 --> 05:36.920
<b>JAKT</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:35.170
we should be able to free our brethren

05:35.170 --> 05:36.790
imprisoned in the imperial capital.

05:37.000 --> 05:39.040
Those human bastards had the audacity

05:37.710 --> 05:42.380
<b>RACE: WEREWOLF</b>

05:37.710 --> 05:42.380
<b>GERÐR HONZAK</b>

05:39.040 --> 05:40.750
to lock us demi-humans up in this garbage dump

05:40.750 --> 05:42.330
and call it a "conservation ward,"

05:42.630 --> 05:44.750
so let's give them somethin' to cry about.

05:43.130 --> 05:45.500
<b>RACE: LEOPARD</b>

05:43.130 --> 05:45.500
<b>JIRAF</b>

05:45.630 --> 05:48.670
Sir Bastea, the humans possess Holy Swords,

05:46.250 --> 05:50.710
<b>RACE: GOBLIN</b>

05:46.250 --> 05:50.710
<b>ELZA</b>

05:48.670 --> 05:50.330
whereas we do not.

05:50.330 --> 05:51.830
Can we hold out against them?

05:53.080 --> 05:54.920
Quit bein' such a killjoy!

05:54.920 --> 05:56.670
I wasn't speaking to you.

05:56.670 --> 05:57.710
'Scuse me?!

05:57.710 --> 05:58.920
Settle down, Gerðr.

05:59.130 --> 06:05.170
It seems the infamous Alpha Wolf Alliance and its
extremists are lacking in the solidarity department.

06:08.130 --> 06:13.040
Who the hell are you?! You find out we're
the Alpha Wolves and now you're mocking us?!

06:13.670 --> 06:20.670
No, I'm offering my assistance. I'm a demi-human myself,
so I share in your resentment towards humans.

06:20.830 --> 06:23.670
And you're willing to help us abduct the princess?

06:24.040 --> 06:29.130
I shall bestow power upon you.
Power that surpasses a Holy Sword.

06:32.960 --> 06:35.710
Is that a… Holy Sword?!

06:40.500 --> 06:42.040
What are you doing…?

06:43.130 --> 06:45.420
You feel it, don't you? The power.

07:01.170 --> 07:02.790
Bastea used a Holy Sword?!

07:03.500 --> 07:06.290
Holy Swords only supposed to manifest for huma-

07:06.290 --> 07:08.250
They aren't Holy Swords.

07:08.710 --> 07:10.960
They're Demon Swords, granted by the Goddess.

07:11.500 --> 07:15.130
With power like that,
our kidnapping plan might actually work!

07:15.290 --> 07:18.580
Anyone else with the necessary skills
will receive one, too.

07:18.880 --> 07:21.960
I'd suggest hijacking the Hyperion
along with the princess.

07:22.040 --> 07:25.790
If we steal the ship, we can sail
straight into the capital and get our pals back!

07:26.130 --> 07:30.830
That being said… would you be so kind
as to fulfill a humble request of mine in return?

07:31.670 --> 07:32.420
What is it?

07:32.830 --> 07:35.500
The Goddess desires a sacrifice.

07:36.130 --> 07:39.250
Allow the Holy Swordsmen to live
and deliver them to me.

07:39.580 --> 07:41.080
Heh, piece of cake.

07:41.080 --> 07:42.920
We should do it, Bastea!

07:43.960 --> 07:45.920
I don't believe I caught your name.

07:46.420 --> 07:50.290
I'm Sharnak, the Witch of Everdark Forest.

07:46.920 --> 07:50.330
<b>DARK ELF</b>

07:46.920 --> 07:50.330
<b>SHARNAK</b>

08:01.790 --> 08:04.040
So that's a human battleship…

08:04.500 --> 08:09.000
When I restore my demonic army,
I must procure two or three ships like that for myself.

08:10.290 --> 08:13.460
Oh, maybe I ought to buy my minion a gift of some sort…

08:14.830 --> 08:16.170
May I look at this one?

08:16.830 --> 08:19.040
For such a young lad, you've got good taste.

08:19.460 --> 08:22.380
This bracelet was crafted by an elf
in the conservation ward.

08:23.580 --> 08:26.290
Members of the elven race live in this city…?

08:26.500 --> 08:28.460
Have you never seen an elf before?

08:28.460 --> 08:32.000
Oh, um… up until recently, I was a refugee, so…

08:32.000 --> 08:33.290
Well, that makes more sense.

08:33.500 --> 08:37.630
The demi-human ward is home to elves, of course,
along with werewolves and lions…

08:37.630 --> 08:40.460
Many different species of survivors reside there.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.290
Isn't she the cutest?!

08:47.290 --> 08:49.380
Look, there's the princess!

09:01.500 --> 09:02.250
Your Highness.

09:02.830 --> 09:03.500
Huh?

09:03.790 --> 09:08.040
The farther you lean over the edge, the more difficult
it becomes to ensure your physical safety.

09:08.420 --> 09:10.630
Oh, you're absolutely right.

09:11.750 --> 09:13.670
I got caught up looking for someone…

09:33.040 --> 09:38.960
I suppose parading a young princess around
would be an easy way to curry favor with the masses…

09:39.380 --> 09:41.500
There he is. Leo!

09:42.580 --> 09:46.380
We've been looking for you.
You didn't mention where to meet you at the harbor.

09:46.790 --> 09:47.790
I'm sorry…

09:47.960 --> 09:49.580
Did you eat your vegetables?

09:49.580 --> 09:50.960
Hey, Miss Selia?

09:51.250 --> 09:52.130
Yeah?

09:52.130 --> 09:54.630
Here. I bought this a few minutes ago.

09:56.290 --> 09:59.040
Wait a second… For me?

09:59.380 --> 10:02.210
Yup. You're always looking out for me, Miss Selia.

10:02.460 --> 10:04.040
Plus, you saved my life.

10:06.080 --> 10:08.290
I-it's just a keychain…

10:08.500 --> 10:09.630
Thank you!

10:10.790 --> 10:11.790
It's adorable.

10:12.210 --> 10:14.170
At least she's not in a bad mood anymore…

10:14.380 --> 10:19.880
I love it, but doing this kind of stuff to girls is exactly
how you end up being a demon lord in the bedroom.

10:20.080 --> 10:21.710
Did she say "Demon Lord"?!

10:22.790 --> 10:25.710
That joke's a little mature
for a ten-year-old, don't you think?

10:26.630 --> 10:29.210
It seems my identity remains a secret for the time being…

10:29.380 --> 10:31.420
C'mon, it's about time we board the ship.

10:32.830 --> 10:35.710
Um, is Miss Regina not coming?

10:36.000 --> 10:38.960
She strikes me as the type
to enjoy parties and stuff like that…

10:39.790 --> 10:40.710
Well…

10:40.710 --> 10:41.330
Perhaps…

10:42.330 --> 10:44.170
Regina has her own set of circumstances.

10:46.290 --> 10:46.880
Omigosh!

10:47.580 --> 10:49.250
Riselia Crystalia!

10:50.250 --> 10:51.830
What are YOU doing here?

10:52.880 --> 10:54.080
Fenris?

10:54.080 --> 10:56.080
Here for a bit of sightseeing, I assume?

10:57.420 --> 11:00.170
My platoon and I were invited
to the commendation ceremony.

11:00.790 --> 11:03.330
Did you come to the harbor just to make snide remarks?

11:03.710 --> 11:07.210
I'm here on behalf of the president
of the Executive Council.

11:07.380 --> 11:09.790
Those of us on the council stay busy 24/7.

11:10.130 --> 11:11.670
Unlike your lazy platoon…

11:11.670 --> 11:12.960
I beg your pardon?!

11:12.960 --> 11:14.790
Okay, okay. No fighting, ladies.

11:14.960 --> 11:17.290
Out of respect for Finé, I'll let it slide.

11:17.290 --> 11:21.540
Yes, the last thing I'd ever want to do
is make Elfiné look bad.

11:22.170 --> 11:23.380
Good day.

11:25.080 --> 11:28.750
I nearly forgot.
Rumor has it you awakened your Holy Sword.

11:28.920 --> 11:30.540
Huh? Oh, yeah…

11:30.750 --> 11:33.540
In that case… congratulations. Or whatever.

11:37.130 --> 11:38.540
Who was that girl?

11:38.790 --> 11:40.330
Fenris Edelritz.

11:40.830 --> 11:42.750
Been stuck with her since we were kids…

12:04.170 --> 12:08.670
Security gets lighter on the seaward side
when the princess makes a public appearance…

12:11.250 --> 12:14.330
Looks like that woman's plan wasn't half bad.

12:15.670 --> 12:17.080
So far, so good.

12:25.920 --> 12:28.420
We couldn't have analyzed the data
without your Holy Sword ability.

12:29.170 --> 12:32.790
Oh, no. The quality and quantity
of the city's data is what made it possible.

12:33.040 --> 12:37.040
Well, thanks to you, we were able to begin our
evacuation procedures without delay.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.500
What are you doing?

12:34.500 --> 12:37.040
Bringing back a souvenir for Mr. Fluffy-wuffy Black Fur.

12:37.040 --> 12:37.880
What…?

12:39.380 --> 12:43.380
I was able to obtain a copy of the reference materials
using a psychography spell, but…

12:44.040 --> 12:48.210
Just as I thought, it appears somebody
is attempting to cover up the historical past.

12:49.000 --> 12:55.380
There isn't a single mention of the gods, the Six Heroes,
the Goddess of Rebellion, or the eight Demon Lords…

12:56.170 --> 13:00.630
Apparently, most documents were lost
in the Void invasion, but that seems too convenient.

13:01.170 --> 13:05.170
I also can't find any details on why sorcery died out
and how magical technology developed.

13:05.960 --> 13:09.750
This is yet another beverage that didn't exist
back in my day, but I quite like it.

13:10.250 --> 13:13.580
The dark color… It's truly fitting for a Demon Lord.

13:14.040 --> 13:15.040
Master.

13:18.170 --> 13:22.790
I don't recall telling you to disguise yourself as waitstaff.
Your orders were to investigate the battleship.

13:24.000 --> 13:26.830
This is the optimal outfit for carrying out my mission.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.460
What have you discovered?

13:33.210 --> 13:36.830
The ship is powered by a mana crystal.
Its defenses are similar to the Assault Garden;

13:36.830 --> 13:41.750
it's equipped with weaponry capable of flying
through the air, including artillery and autocannons.

13:42.420 --> 13:43.790
Flying weapons…?

13:44.080 --> 13:45.130
And the control mechanism?

13:45.290 --> 13:46.670
I'm still gathering intel.

13:47.000 --> 13:48.500
Excellent. Keep it up.

13:48.920 --> 13:51.080
Oh, hold on. I have a present for you.

13:51.080 --> 13:55.880
Huh? M-Master… A p-p-present, for me?!

13:56.630 --> 14:01.330
Of course. You're my one and only maid.
You've stuck by my side through thick and thin.

14:03.540 --> 14:04.750
Master…

14:07.750 --> 14:09.960
Hmm? Um, what is it?

14:09.960 --> 14:12.290
A long, skinny donut called a "churro."

14:13.040 --> 14:13.750
Ah…

14:14.080 --> 14:16.790
What's wrong? Don't you like donuts?

14:17.040 --> 14:18.630
I do, milord, but…

14:19.040 --> 14:22.500
I'm not entirely sure perishable food items
qualify as presents…

14:23.290 --> 14:24.500
You dumb Demon Lord…

14:24.880 --> 14:26.420
What did you just say?!

14:26.420 --> 14:27.420
Leo!

14:38.540 --> 14:39.960
Let's go for a swim together!

14:40.790 --> 14:43.420
I didn't realize Tessera and the others were invited, too…

14:43.670 --> 14:48.960
Her Royal Highness wishes to treat everyone equally
and include people from all walks of life.

14:49.710 --> 14:54.040
Big Brother Leo…
W-will you come play in the pool with us?!

14:54.210 --> 15:00.170
I'm afraid I must decline. The human body isn't designed
to float in water. And I don't have a swimsuit.

15:00.330 --> 15:02.080
Oh, you can't swim!

15:02.210 --> 15:05.460
Th-that's neither here nor there…

15:07.500 --> 15:09.250
I don't mind giving you some lessons.

15:18.330 --> 15:20.790
You're doing good, Leo. Just like that!

15:24.670 --> 15:28.210
I swear, I have the hardest time refusing my minion…

15:28.500 --> 15:32.580
And what's worse…
she's wearing such a risqué swimsuit!

15:32.790 --> 15:34.210
I must reprimand her later!

15:34.420 --> 15:36.040
Lucky you, Leo.

15:36.210 --> 15:39.170
With Selia as your teacher,
you'll learn how to swim in no time.

15:39.540 --> 15:42.630
Plus, it's undignified for a Holy Swordsman
to be a poor swimmer.

15:42.920 --> 15:44.170
Swim practice, eh?

15:44.170 --> 15:45.880
That little boy is a Holy Swordsman?

15:45.960 --> 15:47.250
It's part of their training.

15:48.040 --> 15:49.580
Oops, it went the wrong way!

15:50.330 --> 15:51.540
Sorry!

15:53.250 --> 15:55.000
Hang in there, Big Brother Leo!

15:55.290 --> 15:57.290
You guys are great swimmers!

15:58.080 --> 16:01.080
I can't believe I'm being outdone by children…

16:07.330 --> 16:09.290
Guess it's almost time for the princess' speech.

16:12.080 --> 16:14.710
Come on. What am I even doing…?

16:30.290 --> 16:31.040
Wha-?!

16:36.330 --> 16:37.290
Arcus…?!

16:46.040 --> 16:49.210
Princess Artiria, you must escape…

16:50.290 --> 16:51.670
Arcus!

16:52.920 --> 16:55.540
Please come along quietly, Your Royal Highness.

16:55.540 --> 16:56.460
Go!

16:58.250 --> 16:58.960
Huh?!

17:00.080 --> 17:00.710
Tsk…

17:01.130 --> 17:05.880
Letting the master key run off
changes nothing, brave princess…

17:06.500 --> 17:09.880
In just a few minutes, we'll have everyone
move into the audience chamber.

17:13.170 --> 17:14.080
If you move, you die!

17:24.630 --> 17:25.830
Demi-humans…

17:26.080 --> 17:29.290
And they likely have accomplices.
I'd better bide my time…

17:29.880 --> 17:32.500
Activate: Face Thief.

17:33.380 --> 17:35.000
No way… A Holy Sword?

17:35.170 --> 17:36.960
More like a ridiculous hoax.

17:37.170 --> 17:40.960
Everyone knows humans are the only ones
blessed with the ability to wield Holy Swords.

17:42.210 --> 17:44.920
I told you not to move! Last warning.

17:46.580 --> 17:49.080
Activate: Bomb Apple.

17:52.670 --> 17:55.330
The elf might be old, but he ain't stupid.

17:55.540 --> 17:58.960
Activate your Holy Sword
an' you'll learn that the hard way.

17:59.750 --> 18:02.960
No funny business, or else I'll detonate it.

18:10.080 --> 18:13.920
We're takin' your beloved princess hostage, too.

18:14.500 --> 18:16.290
Serves the brat right!

18:18.580 --> 18:20.960
Wh-what is it you want?

18:21.710 --> 18:23.670
For our buddies to be released from prison.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.710
It's too bad the empire doesn't negotiate with terrorists!

18:27.000 --> 18:29.710
You're pissin' me off! You got a death wish?!

18:29.830 --> 18:30.790
Cut it out.

18:30.790 --> 18:33.290
She instructed us not to kill
the Holy Swordsmen, remember?

18:34.420 --> 18:35.830
Yeah, yeah…

18:35.830 --> 18:38.130
So we can sacrifice 'em to a goddess or whatever.

18:39.210 --> 18:40.250
Did he say "goddess"…?

18:40.710 --> 18:45.670
And it was the Goddess who gave us these powers
in the first place, so I guess I'll behave…

18:46.170 --> 18:46.920
Miss Selia.

18:47.750 --> 18:49.710
I'm going to go make sure the princess is safe.

18:50.380 --> 18:51.830
We'll have to split up this time.

18:52.250 --> 18:53.540
Huh? Wait-

18:53.830 --> 18:54.460
Huh?!

18:56.670 --> 18:57.420
Where's the kid?

18:57.420 --> 18:58.380
Shh!

19:20.630 --> 19:22.880
I've… activated the engine.

19:23.790 --> 19:29.420
An Artificial Elemental capable of tampering
with a state-of-the-art warship… Smart thinking.

19:30.080 --> 19:34.210
If I do as you say, you promise to let
the innocent bystanders go?

19:34.830 --> 19:35.920
Of course.

19:35.920 --> 19:38.080
Alright, head towards the capital!

19:40.000 --> 19:41.670
I've set a course to take us there.

19:43.330 --> 19:45.630
We'd be sailing directly into a Void reef!

19:46.210 --> 19:46.920
Steer around it.

19:47.210 --> 19:50.960
No, stay on course and crash the ship into the reef.

19:51.330 --> 19:53.710
What?! But we'll be overrun by Voids!

19:53.710 --> 19:59.500
Holy Swordsmen tainted by a miasma of nothingness
would be the perfect offering for the Goddess.

20:00.250 --> 20:03.330
I couldn't give less of a shit about your plan!

20:04.080 --> 20:06.630
So you've shown your true colors at last…

20:06.880 --> 20:07.750
This ends now!

20:10.830 --> 20:12.960
You're hopelessly stupid, aren't you?

20:16.790 --> 20:20.420
You thought you could kill me
with the Demon Sword I gave you?

20:21.830 --> 20:24.880
DAMN YOU…!

20:25.830 --> 20:26.920
Bastea!

20:29.080 --> 20:32.210
If you wish to live, then I require your obedience.

20:38.000 --> 20:39.290
Hey, the ship's moving!

20:39.330 --> 20:41.750
But why?! It's supposed to leave tomorrow!

20:48.250 --> 20:50.210
Hey! Stop!

20:50.210 --> 20:52.040
This isn't on the schedule!

20:56.670 --> 20:58.290
The royal family's Carbuncle?

20:58.540 --> 20:59.830
What's it doing here…?

21:01.380 --> 21:05.830
"If you manage to make it to the harbor…
do whatever you can to call for help!"

21:14.960 --> 21:15.880
Come back!

21:19.830 --> 21:20.830
Hya!

21:31.130 --> 21:32.880
It seems I've gotten lost…

21:33.670 --> 21:38.210
Do I smash my way through? The bridge should be
right above here. It's not like anyone's watching…

21:39.710 --> 21:41.500
Is that a… spirit?

21:44.330 --> 21:45.330
Kid?!

21:45.580 --> 21:47.790
Miss Regina? What are you doing here?

21:48.750 --> 21:49.630
My little sister…

21:50.040 --> 21:50.670
Huh?

21:52.040 --> 21:53.630
My little sister's in danger!

23:27.540 --> 23:30.500
I want to show off my swimsuit in front of Master, too!

23:31.290 --> 23:33.460
It's not much different from your usual outfit.

23:33.960 --> 23:36.420
Of course it is. It's a swimsuit, Blackus. A swimsuit.

23:36.630 --> 23:38.670
I'm sure all of you like swimsuits, too.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.540
Who are you talking to right now…?

23:46.920 --> 23:51.040
<b>A BOND EVERLASTING</b>
